    "「%@」（%@）虽然也是这个场景的话，但对不上空格处的上下文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” (%@) is also from this scene, but doesn't match the context of the space."
